<title>HONG KONG: Dairy Farm names new Asia director.</title>
<headline>Dairy Farm names new Asia director.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dairy Farm International Holdings Ltd on Thursday announced the appointment of Gene Auerbach as regional director for Asia.</p>
<p>Auerbach was senior vice president for international operations for PriceCostco in Southern California before joining Dairy Farm last year, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Dairy Farm operates supermarkets, convenience stores and drugstores and pharmacies in China, Hong Kong, Taiwan and Southeast Asia.</p>
<p>-- HONG KONG NEWSROOM (852) 2843-6441</p>
